+ * 2e-7) / 0.48e-6 / br * 2) rrg=avrrrg + rgviaarray rgm1=0.10482 * (lr + 5.6e-7)
+ / 1e-06 rgm2=0.05967 * (lr + 5.6e-7) / 2.63e-06 rgmhead=1 / (1 / rgm1 + 1 / rgm2)
