inline subckt nch_mis ( d g s b ) 
parameters l=1u w=1u multi=1 factor=1 sa=0.35e-6 sb=0.35e-6 ad=2 * hdifn 
+ / factor * w as=2 * hdifn / factor * w pd=2 * (2 * hdifn / factor + w) ps=2 * 
+ (2 * hdifn / factor + w) nrd=hdifn / factor / w nrs=hdifn / factor / w temp1=parn1 
+ temp2=parn2 fac1=0.630 * temp1 + 0.776 * temp2 fac2=0.630 * temp1 - 0.776 * temp2 
+ lef=l - 2.0e-8 wef=w + 1.5e-8 geo_fac=1 / sqrt(multi * lef * wef * 1e12) vthmisn=0.002536 
+ * geo_fac * fac1 dlmisn=0.002159 * geo_fac * lef * fac2 dwmisn= - 0.002159 * geo_fac 
+ * wef * fac2 toxmisn=0.002159 * geo_fac * toxn * fac2 
