inline subckt pch_mis ( d g s b ) 
parameters l=1u w=1u multi=1 factor=1 sa=0.35e-6 sb=0.35e-6 ad=2 * hdifp 
+ / factor * w as=2 * hdifp / factor * w pd=2 * (2 * hdifp / factor + w) ps=2 * 
+ (2 * hdifp / factor + w) nrd=hdifp / factor / w nrs=hdifp / factor / w temp1=parp1 
+ temp2=parp2 fac1=0.778 * temp1 + 0.629 * temp2 fac2=0.778 * temp1 - 0.629 * temp2 
+ lef=l - 2.0e-8 wef=w + 1.5e-8 geo_fac=1 / sqrt(multi * lef * wef * 1e12) vthmisp=0.002585 
+ * geo_fac * fac1 dlmisp=0.001932 * geo_fac * lef * fac2 dwmisp= - 0.001932 * geo_fac 
+ * wef * fac2 toxmisp=0.001932 * geo_fac * toxp * fac2 
pch_mis ( d g s b ) pch w=w l=l ad=ad as=as pd=pd ps=ps nrd=nrd nrs=nrs m=multi sa=sa 
+ sb=sb
