inline subckt pch_25_mis ( d g s b ) 
parameters l=1u w=1u factor=1 multi=1 sa=0.35u sb=0.35u ad=2 * hdifp_25 / factor * 
+ w as=2 * hdifp_25 / factor * w pd=2 * (2 * hdifp_25 / factor + w) ps=2 * (2 * hdifp_25 
+ / factor + w) nrd=hdifp_25 / factor / w nrs=hdifp_25 / factor / w temp1=parp1_25 
