inline subckt nch_lvt_mis ( d g s b ) 
parameters l=1u w=1u multi=1 factor=1 sa=0.35e-6 sb=0.35e-6 ad=2 * hdifn_lvt 
+ / factor * w as=2 * hdifn_lvt / factor * w pd=2 * (2 * hdifn_lvt / factor + w) 
+ ps=2 * (2 * hdifn_lvt / factor + w) nrd=hdifn_lvt / factor / w nrs=hdifn_lvt / 
+ factor / w temp1=parn1_lvt temp2=parn2_lvt fac1=0.591 * temp1 + 0.806 * temp2 
+ fac2=0.591 * temp1 - 0.806 * temp2 lef=l - 2.0e-8 wef=w + 1.5e-8 geo_fac=1 / sqrt(multi 
+ * lef * wef * 1e12) vthmisn_lvt=0.002344 * geo_fac * fac1 dlmisn_lvt=0.002069 
+ * geo_fac * lef * fac2 dwmisn_lvt= - 0.002069 * geo_fac * wef * fac2 toxmisn_lvt=0.002069 
+ * geo_fac * toxn_lvt * fac2 
nch_lvt_mis ( d g s b ) nch_lvt w=w l=l ad=ad as=as pd=pd ps=ps nrd=nrd nrs=nrs m=multi sa=sa 
+ sb=sb
