inline subckt nch_lvt25_mis ( d g s b ) 
parameters l=1u w=1u factor=1 multi=1 sa=0.35u sb=0.35u ad=2 * hdifn_lvt25 / factor 
+ * w as=2 * hdifn_lvt25 / factor * w pd=2 * (2 * hdifn_lvt25 / factor + w) ps=2 * 
+ (2 * hdifn_lvt25 / factor + w) nrd=hdifn_lvt25 / factor / w nrs=hdifn_lvt25 / factor 
+ / w temp1=parn1_lvt25 temp2=parn2_lvt25 fac1=0.484 * temp1 + 0.875 * temp2 fac2=0.484 
+ * temp1 - 0.875 * temp2 lef=l - 4.0e-8 wef=w + 1.0e-8 geo_fac=1 / sqrt(multi * 
+ lef * wef * 1e12) vthmis=0.005731 * geo_fac * fac1 dlmis=0.001943 * geo_fac * 
+ lef * fac2 dwmis= - 0.001943 * geo_fac * wef * fac2 toxmis=0.001943 * geo_fac 
+ * toxn_lvt25 * fac2 
