inline subckt nch_hvt_mis ( d g s b ) 
parameters l=1u w=1u factor=1 multi=1 sa=0.35u sb=0.35u ad=2 * hdifn_hvt / factor * 
+ w as=2 * hdifn_hvt / factor * w pd=2 * (2 * hdifn_hvt / factor + w) ps=2 * (2 * 
+ hdifn_hvt / factor + w) nrd=hdifn_hvt / factor / w nrs=hdifn_hvt / factor / w temp1=parn1_hvt 
+ temp2=parn2_hvt fac1=0.716 * temp1 + 0.699 * temp2 fac2=0.716 * temp1 - 0.699 
+ * temp2 lef=l - 2.0e-8 wef=w + 1.5e-8 geo_fac=1 / sqrt(multi * lef * wef * 1e12) 
+ vthmis=0.003033 * geo_fac * fac1 dlmis=0.002080 * geo_fac * lef * fac2 dwmis= 
+ - 0.002080 * geo_fac * wef * fac2 toxmis=0.002080 * geo_fac * toxn_hvt * fac2 
nch_hvt_mis ( d g s b ) nch_hvt w=w l=l ad=ad as=as pd=pd ps=ps nrd=nrd nrs=nrs m=multi sa=sa 
+ sb=sb
